<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Askari Bank net 37.71 pct up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Askari Bank net 37.71 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Profit before tax   582.36 vs 450.08</p>
<p>    Profit after tax    238.36 vs 173.08</p>
<p>Dividend nil vs nil (per 10-rupee share)</p>
<p>    Bonus issues	  15 pct vs 10 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Askari Commercial Bank Ltd. Book closure March 18-27. AGM will be held in Rawalpindi on March 27.</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
